MIT License above, the following condition applies to any use, copy,
modification, fork, deployment, or distribution of the Software, whether
commercial or non-commercial, public or private, and regardless of any
re-branding or white-labeling applied to it:

1. **Visible attribution.** Any instance of the Software (or a derivative
