   internal company use, and forks that are never publicly distributed.

3. **Independent of re-branding.** This requirement applies regardless of
   any other product name, logo, or branding that the licensee applies to
   the Software. The licensee may commercialize the Software and present it
   under its own brand, provided this attribution remains visible as
   described above.

4. **Material breach.** Failure to comply with this Additional Attribution
